{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CclkOR0DBi1794959145.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受一道冷鋒逐漸南移影響，天文台預料本港氣溫將下降，由市區日間最高約27度，降至晚上最低約21度，新界再低兩、三度。</p><p></p><p>天文台署理高級科學主任黎宏駿表示：「預計這道冷鋒會在今天稍後橫過廣東沿岸，到時本港天氣也會有所變化。預計未來一兩日大致多雲，天氣顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫約15、16度，新界再低兩、三度。同時，高地風寒效應會較為明顯及寒冷。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WnQdRK5B0f1794959227.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台提醒市民，特別是進行戶外活動人士，要留意天氣變化及注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。預料到下周初，氣溫會回升至最高24度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:42:54.286224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T18:37:37.521201+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:36:18.813749+00:00","content_hash":"f4307c64368c6c750808dfcac494126ca2819e7c03cb805bdadde573f3ab139b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:42:54.286224+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}